abstract: >-
  Scientific Ontology (SO) / 存在境界論 Public Edition v4.0.0 is a
  public-facing conceptual archive and documentation release for a
  boundary-based framework describing existence, knowledge, meaning,
  communication, ethics, AI usefulness, social systems, and research-facing
  theoretical notes through history, boundary, operational correspondence,
  collation, residual retention, residue formation, intrinsic time, and the
  logical-depth axis. This release consolidates the public Japanese name
  存在境界論, redesigns the repository as an English-accessible public entrance,
  standardizes README navigation, expands Research Notes including
  physical/cosmological and negentropy-economy materials, adds Visual
  Materials and conceptual posters, and clarifies the relation between
  high-entropy observation-based science and low-entropy activity-based
  top-down theory. It is not an empirical scientific theory, an AI runtime
  package, a policy doctrine, or a disclosure of private core materials.
